{"name": "The Melty Way", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/856b54d2e4c7965a74d0100b0ca041b7.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/65173e166b9d492529af2a808192fe9d.poster.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/65173e166b9d492529af2a808192fe9d.webm?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/65173e166b9d492529af2a808192fe9d.mp4?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a <i><strong>liquid-simulated slime</strong></i> where <strong>every move costs you a piece of yourself</strong>. To reach The Melty Way, you must master slime physics and constantly rebalance your mass, sacrificing resilience for agility and back again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/ae6c5abc31fb2f31711ef52ad94c8c98.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/b1756cfd1c14d249847eb652b37466fa.poster.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/b1756cfd1c14d249847eb652b37466fa.webm?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/b1756cfd1c14d249847eb652b37466fa.mp4?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your body is your only resource.</strong> Every pixel you move is a pixel left behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/157dc3cd5d36a4b5cd8496f1b861c679.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/1bdbfa70fab3acc4c53c80c30199f27f.poster.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/1bdbfa70fab3acc4c53c80c30199f27f.webm?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/1bdbfa70fab3acc4c53c80c30199f27f.mp4?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shrink</strong> to squeeze through tight tunnels and gain explosive speed to clear impossible gaps.<br/><strong>Grow</strong> to gain the weight needed to manipulate the environment and survive punishing hazards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/af8ee9a39da4b44ca7d1b231c7a6a7d1.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/15d8983da52e9c515bdc6db1f24abc3e.poster.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/15d8983da52e9c515bdc6db1f24abc3e.webm?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/15d8983da52e9c515bdc6db1f24abc3e.mp4?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Masocore</strong> challenges where success means \u201c<strong>Mastering the Melt</strong>\u201d and executing pixel-perfect precision across levels designed to push your reflexes, AND your mind, to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/5b5340a368417b862a7e5786e3a81e16.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/5af31f958d1e34bebbcb6e314d2c356f.poster.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/5af31f958d1e34bebbcb6e314d2c356f.webm?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/5af31f958d1e34bebbcb6e314d2c356f.mp4?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>Discover new mechanics</strong> on your journey that <strong>reshape</strong> how each trial is overcome. From movement to environmental interactions, every biome introduces new challenges to master. Progress is only made through <strong>mastery</strong> of every new system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/de95dfe18c12c3c1347677abadc4bde2.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/297d10a275b55c3a45d7a72ac0db3b5c.poster.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/297d10a275b55c3a45d7a72ac0db3b5c.webm?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/297d10a275b55c3a45d7a72ac0db3b5c.mp4?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Intelligent interactions shape every level and hasty decisions can have disastrous consequences. Objects and hazards react dynamically to your actions, forcing you to observe, experiment, and adapt. Success comes from assessing the situation and using your big beautiful brain to stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/208592961e2fe83aa7157f4791146fa6.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/10a0db9aac8938662838f8a98633cae8.poster.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/10a0db9aac8938662838f8a98633cae8.webm?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/10a0db9aac8938662838f8a98633cae8.mp4?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Explore 6 distinct worlds where the environment is as beautiful as it is deadly. Each biome introduces new mechanics that you\u2019ll need to master to overcome the dangers that lie ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/f3ac9855144242d99daf98848389e155.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/8171c97c438e9646085a836fecb04f4f.poster.avif?t=1778878818\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/8171c97c438e9646085a836fecb04f4f.webm?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/8171c97c438e9646085a836fecb04f4f.mp4?t=1778878818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your survival doesn\u2019t have to be colorless. Uncover secret paths and hidden challenges to unlock unique slime colors and skins. Prove your mastery by reclaiming your form in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "You move, you melt. You are a liquid-simulated slime where every move costs you a piece of yourself. Spend your mass to slide, shrink, and dash through pixel-perfect hazards in this challenging precision platformer where size management is critical and your only resource is your own body.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/16447566c605276d944c35c068005af8f78de379/header.jpg?t=1778878818", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Platformer", "Action", "Precision Platformer", "2D Platformer", "Difficult", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "G Doubl\u00e9", "publishers": "G Doubl\u00e9", "release_date": "May 15, 2026", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "3990570", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "4 February 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/3oy0h4PZyKs", "first_seen": 1770163200.0, "review_rank": 1270}